^Kubernetes e2e suite (\[sig-scheduling\] SchedulerPreemption validates basic preemption works \[Conformance\] \[Serial\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] Aggregator Should be able to support the 1\.17 Sample API Server using the current Aggregator \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\]|\[sig-api-machinery\] MutatingAdmissionPolicy \[Privileged:ClusterAdmin\] should mutate a Deployment \[Conformance\]|\[sig-apps\] CronJob should not schedule new jobs when ForbidConcurrent \[Conformance\] \[Slow\]|\[sig-apps\] ReplicaSet Replicaset should have a working scale subresource \[Conformance\]|\[sig-auth\] ServiceAccounts should mount an API token into pods \[Conformance\]|\[sig-instrumentation\] Events API should delete a collection of events \[Conformance\]|\[sig-network\] Proxy version v1 should proxy through a service and a pod \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] Container Runtime blackbox test on terminated container should report termination message if TerminationMessagePath is set as non-root user and at a non-default path \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-node\] PodTemplates should run the lifecycle of PodTemplates \[Conformance\]|\[sig-node\] Secrets should be consumable from pods in env vars \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] ConfigMap optional updates should be reflected in volume \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] EmptyDir volumes should support \(root,0777,default\) \[LinuxOnly\] \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\]|\[sig-storage\] Projected secret should be consumable from pods in volume with mappings \[Conformance\] \[NodeConformance\])$
